#: ../../index.rst:31 551cfa2dc48a49939005d39a6bb9faf4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ToolUniverse is a unified ecosystem that transforms any large language "
"model (LLM)—open or closed—into a powerful AI scientist. By standardizing"
" how LLMs identify and call tools, it integrates over **1000 scientific "
"resources**, including machine learning models, datasets, APIs, and "
"analysis packages."
msgstr ""
"ToolUniverse 是一个统一的生态系统，可以将任何大型语言模型（LLM）——无论是开源还是闭源——转化为强大的 AI 科学家。通过标准化 "
"LLM 识别和调用工具的方式，它集成了超过 600 个科学资源，包括机器学习模型、数据集、API 和分析包。"

#: ../../index.rst:33 0f7665e6b25a47db9a89194a8dd73ff9
msgid ""
"With its **AI-Tool Interaction Protocol**, ToolUniverse provides a common"
" interface for seamless communication between LLMs and tools, ensuring "
"compatibility across platforms such as GPT, Claude, Gemini, and open-"
"source models."
msgstr ""
"通过其 **AI-工具交互协议**，ToolUniverse 为 LLM 和工具之间的无缝通信提供了一个通用接口，确保在 "
"GPT、Claude、Gemini 和开源模型等平台上的兼容性。"

